    "text": "If the mean and variance of six observations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;respectively, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>|</mo></math> is equal to:",
