  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p>Mean<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>And,</p><p>Variance<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>11</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>495</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>320</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>495</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>640</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>145</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Solve&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
